# Charter folder documentation

When editing files under `_oracreek/`, use the Oracreek Charter docs as the authority instead of restating their guidance here.

## Start here

- Read `_oracreek/README.md` for the Oracreek Charter overview, canonical locations, slash-command flow, and agent operating guidance.
- Read `_oracreek/WORKFLOW.md` for status definitions, verification requirements, consolidation policy, and agent responsibilities.

## Follow linked sources

- Use `_oracreek/feature-catalog.md`, relevant files in `_oracreek/stories/`, `_oracreek/architecture/`, and `_oracreek/decisions/`, and templates in `_oracreek/templates/` as directed by those docs.
- If guidance appears duplicated or conflicting, preserve the canonical source and update links rather than creating another copy.
